    "traits": "Alteration, Warding",
    "description": "ALTERATION UTILITY WARDING\nTradition verdant\nCast 2 AP (somatic, verbal)\nRange touch\nTargets 1 willing creature\nDuration 1 hour\n\nA nearly invisible layer of harmless protective spores and natural microorganisms settles across the target.\nThe target gains a +2-status bonus to saving throws against Disease, Poison and harmful fungal or spore effects.\nThis spell does not protect against effects merely because they originated from a fungal creature if the effect itself is unrelated to disease, poison or spores.\n\nWarping Options:\n+1 PP: Affect one additional target.\n+2 PP: Increase the duration to 8 hours.\n+2 PP: Increase the bonus by 1, maximum +4.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 10."
